        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "You're right! Sorry for not checking enough.\nIt works perfectly, thank you. Here's the settings I used if anyone else comes across this:\n```lua\nrequire('mini.surround').setup({\n    custom_surroundings = {\n      [\"「\"] = { input = { \"「().-()」\" }, output = { left = \"「\", right = \"」\" } },\n      [\"｛\"] = { input = { \"｛「().-()｝\" }, output = { left = \"｛\", right = \"｝\" } },\n      [\"（\"] = { input = { \"（().-()）\" }, output = { left = \"（\", right = \"）\" } },\n    },\n})\n```",
